(3537591, 495823, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is really a great piece of art, and a unique perspective on bicycle parts. The shapes and colors of the background are wonderful. Excellent in every way! 10 from me.</td>', 'This is really a great piece of art, and a unique perspective on bicycle parts. The shapes and colors of the background are wonderful. Excellent in every way! 10 from me.', '2007-04-11 02:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3537598, 495981, 28070, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a cool shot and creative. I''m going to give you a 9 since it is only a bicycle seat, no wheels, handle bars, gears, all the components to make it a bicycle.  I would have liked to see a pair of handle bars along with the seat, cause I can''t picture the whole bike in the ground from how high the seat  is sticking out.  This is a long comment, well I''ll be moving along now.  Great picture!</td>', 'Wow, this is a cool shot and creative. I''m going to give you a 9 since it is only a bicycle seat, no wheels, handle bars, gears, all the components to make it a bicycle.  I would have liked to see a pair of handle bars along with the seat, cause I can''t picture the whole bike in the ground from how high the seat  is sticking out.  This is a long comment, well I''ll be moving along now.  Great picture!', '2007-04-11 02:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3537607, 495110, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool effect!  I feel like I''m riding with no hands.  Great Idea.  I love the movement.</td>', 'This is a very cool effect!  I feel like I''m riding with no hands.  Great Idea.  I love the movement.', '2007-04-11 02:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
