(3538614, 495306, 13611, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, maybe because it represents a time for me when I didn''t go out on my bike (due to an injury). The colour is great and the idea is brilliant. Maybe keep more of the seat in focus next time? Still by far my favourite shot of the challenge. 10</td>', 'I love this shot, maybe because it represents a time for me when I didn''t go out on my bike (due to an injury). The colour is great and the idea is brilliant. Maybe keep more of the seat in focus next time? Still by far my favourite shot of the challenge. 10', '2007-04-11 10:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
