(3539859, 493060, 43088, '<td valign="top">I think that cropping a bit more out of the foreground would help with the overall composition. Maybe to the bottom of the first post on the left. That would move the rider a bit more into the picture. He is a bit tight into the corner for me. Otherwise great. I like the way the rider is looking in the same direction as the figures on the bridge.  6.</td>', 'I think that cropping a bit more out of the foreground would help with the overall composition. Maybe to the bottom of the first post on the left. That would move the rider a bit more into the picture. He is a bit tight into the corner for me. Otherwise great. I like the way the rider is looking in the same direction as the figures on the bridge.  6.', '2007-04-11 14:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539868, 495395, 43088, '<td valign="top">A nice shot but something is trying to push me out of it- not quite sure what. Maybe too grey in the sky? It does not look natural.</td>', 'A nice shot but something is trying to push me out of it- not quite sure what. Maybe too grey in the sky? It does not look natural.', '2007-04-11 15:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539879, 495576, 43088, '<td valign="top">Did you shoot this while driving /riding by? That is tough to get a good shot. If you had the chance to do it again, I would have moved a bit more to your right to be more head- on relative to the wall. Your movement also unfortunately left it a bit blurred too. Otherwise I really like the image.</td>', 'Did you shoot this while driving /riding by? That is tough to get a good shot. If you had the chance to do it again, I would have moved a bit more to your right to be more head- on relative to the wall. Your movement also unfortunately left it a bit blurred too. Otherwise I really like the image.', '2007-04-11 15:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539883, 494595, 43088, '<td valign="top">NIce simplicity and well exposed.</td>', 'NIce simplicity and well exposed.', '2007-04-11 15:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539896, 496132, 43088, '<td valign="top">What a find! But I feel we are only getting part of the story here. The way the composition is arranged, the tree is the main subject while it should be the bikes. Maybe angle the camera down a bit more.</td>', 'What a find! But I feel we are only getting part of the story here. The way the composition is arranged, the tree is the main subject while it should be the bikes. Maybe angle the camera down a bit more.', '2007-04-11 15:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539904, 495290, 43088, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. I would guess a long exposure with the figure not in the frame the entire time of the exposure. Very creative!</td>', 'Very interesting. I would guess a long exposure with the figure not in the frame the entire time of the exposure. Very creative!', '2007-04-11 15:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539912, 495613, 43088, '<td valign="top">A bit underexposed.</td>', 'A bit underexposed.', '2007-04-11 15:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
