(3539923, 496015, 43088, '<td valign="top">Too bad he is cut off a bit. if you could have had all of him and the taxi on the right it would have been great.</td>', 'Too bad he is cut off a bit. if you could have had all of him and the taxi on the right it would have been great.', '2007-04-11 15:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
