(3540778, 495868, 74496, '<td valign="top">Oh what a great capture, and perfect title!  I think you have captured the essence of bicycles!!</td>', 'Oh what a great capture, and perfect title!  I think you have captured the essence of bicycles!!', '2007-04-11 20:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
