(3542924, 493248, 51793, '<td valign="top">You''re trying to influence the voters to give you high scores by putting a hot girl on your subject but it kinda takes away from picture. Since I can''t really see the bike other than the white I will say that that she would have looked better standing up next to the bike showing it off vs. sitting on it. Also the shadow on her face is a bit to dark but I understand it''s basic editing. Giving the direction of the sun I would have flipped her around so the sun was in her face showing that off too. <br/> <br/>Other than the little extra she has in her hips she is very attractive. If she is yours congrats. She is beautiful. If not she should be. If this is she is you well I''ll stop there. <br/> <br/>Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'You''re trying to influence the voters to give you high scores by putting a hot girl on your subject but it kinda takes away from picture. Since I can''t really see the bike other than the white I will say that that she would have looked better standing up next to the bike showing it off vs. sitting on it. Also the shadow on her face is a bit to dark but I understand it''s basic editing. Giving the direction of the sun I would have flipped her around so the sun was in her face showing that off too.  Other than the little extra she has in her hips she is very attractive. If she is yours congrats. She is beautiful. If not she should be. If this is she is you well I''ll stop there.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2007-04-12 13:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3542932, 495884, 51793, '<td valign="top">If there is 2 things I can''t stand it''s people on bikes in the middle of the road and people on Cell phones driving. Here you have incorporated both in to one. <br/>When I first looked at the picture my wild side came out and I was thinking "GET OUT OF THE ROAD YOU A-HOLE", then I was like well this is a very cool looking picture. You have included the bike rider into your background and it blends well. Good job... 7</td>', 'If there is 2 things I can''t stand it''s people on bikes in the middle of the road and people on Cell phones driving. Here you have incorporated both in to one. When I first looked at the picture my wild side came out and I was thinking "GET OUT OF THE ROAD YOU A-HOLE", then I was like well this is a very cool looking picture. You have included the bike rider into your background and it blends well. Good job... 7', '2007-04-12 13:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
