(3543551, 495837, 42100, '<td valign="top">The framing of the trail and landscape is great in this photo.  Because of  the rocky section I would have loved to seen the rider navigating the more difficult terrain.  That would of also of put him in the rule of thirds position and entering, rather than leaving the photo.  Some very nice eye grabbing colors.<br/> <br/>Damn, now you got me longing to go out and ride...it''s been a long, long time!</td>', 'The framing of the trail and landscape is great in this photo.  Because of  the rocky section I would have loved to seen the rider navigating the more difficult terrain.  That would of also of put him in the rule of thirds position and entering, rather than leaving the photo.  Some very nice eye grabbing colors. Damn, now you got me longing to go out and ride...it''s been a long, long time!', '2007-04-12 17:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
