(3544735, 496063, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!!!!! Very emotional feeling, and the abstract-yet-concrete feel of it makes it seem like a college.</td>', 'Wonderful!!!!! Very emotional feeling, and the abstract-yet-concrete feel of it makes it seem like a college.', '2007-04-13 02:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
