(3545679, 495692, 68586, '<td valign="top">A sweet shot.<br/> <br/>Technically the shot would be stronger if there were not quite so many strong lines in the background which tend to distract, and if the little girl was on the right cycling ''into'' the picture, instead of cycling out of it. I do like the shadow of the trees though and you have a very pretty model there so I am sure you can get plenty more pictures of her.</td>', 'A sweet shot. Technically the shot would be stronger if there were not quite so many strong lines in the background which tend to distract, and if the little girl was on the right cycling ''into'' the picture, instead of cycling out of it. I do like the shadow of the trees though and you have a very pretty model there so I am sure you can get plenty more pictures of her.', '2007-04-13 13:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3545684, 496115, 68586, '<td valign="top">Nice strong colours, interesting choice of going for motion blur and static background.<br/>As the background has quite a lot of lines and distractions (goal on the right, red frame on the left, building showing through the trees etc), I think I would have been more tempted to pan with the cyclists, keep their colour and vibrancy, and blur the background. This is obviously personal taste though  :-  )</td>', 'Nice strong colours, interesting choice of going for motion blur and static background.As the background has quite a lot of lines and distractions (goal on the right, red frame on the left, building showing through the trees etc), I think I would have been more tempted to pan with the cyclists, keep their colour and vibrancy, and blur the background. This is obviously personal taste though  :-  )', '2007-04-13 13:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3545689, 496015, 68586, '<td valign="top">Interesting crop and composition. Nice strong colours.</td>', 'Interesting crop and composition. Nice strong colours.', '2007-04-13 13:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3545719, 495032, 9478, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but it is too much out of focus.</td>', 'I like the composition, but it is too much out of focus.', '2007-04-13 14:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3545723, 494977, 3569, '<td valign="top">too dark to me</td>', 'too dark to me', '2007-04-13 14:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
