(3545743, 494632, 76796, '<td valign="top">I tried and tried to come up with a photograph for this contest... I did close-ups, weird angles, motion shots... nothing came out the way I wanted. Guess it turns out that a simple shot like this is what I should have gone for. I love this shot, and the title fits it perfectly.</td>', 'I tried and tried to come up with a photograph for this contest... I did close-ups, weird angles, motion shots... nothing came out the way I wanted. Guess it turns out that a simple shot like this is what I should have gone for. I love this shot, and the title fits it perfectly.', '2007-04-13 14:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3545752, 495131, 23098, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the spin, great comp. One of my top favorites.</td>', 'Good capture of the spin, great comp. One of my top favorites.', '2007-04-13 14:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
