(3547391, 494632, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!</td>', 'Wonderful!', '2007-04-14 14:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547393, 495336, 30982, '<td valign="top">Outstanding detail.</td>', 'Outstanding detail.', '2007-04-14 14:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547394, 495770, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  Since when did clows have to wear ID tags, though?  Nice shot, nice toning.</td>', 'Heh!  Since when did clows have to wear ID tags, though?  Nice shot, nice toning.', '2007-04-14 14:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547396, 494493, 30982, '<td valign="top">They look like they''re having fun!</td>', 'They look like they''re having fun!', '2007-04-14 14:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547397, 495049, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice presentation.  A bit more of the name on the shock and it could be an ad.</td>', 'Nice presentation.  A bit more of the name on the shock and it could be an ad.', '2007-04-14 14:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547433, 495439, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a shame.  Love the photograph, hate what they did to the bike.  The shadows and tones contribute well to this.</td>', 'What a shame.  Love the photograph, hate what they did to the bike.  The shadows and tones contribute well to this.', '2007-04-14 15:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547435, 494967, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful look of apprehension.  Some may say it''s too dark, but I think it conveys the mood well this way.</td>', 'Wonderful look of apprehension.  Some may say it''s too dark, but I think it conveys the mood well this way.', '2007-04-14 15:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547436, 494455, 30982, '<td valign="top">Crisp and clean - nice comp, too.</td>', 'Crisp and clean - nice comp, too.', '2007-04-14 15:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547443, 495790, 30982, '<td valign="top">I quite like how the bike isn''t the first thing I see.  It''s just kinda quietly there.</td>', 'I quite like how the bike isn''t the first thing I see.  It''s just kinda quietly there.', '2007-04-14 15:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547445, 495785, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great comp - wonderful strong diagonal.</td>', 'Great comp - wonderful strong diagonal.', '2007-04-14 15:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547446, 495861, 30982, '<td valign="top">That''s an intriguing contraption!</td>', 'That''s an intriguing contraption!', '2007-04-14 15:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547447, 495884, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  Great capture.</td>', 'Heh!  Great capture.', '2007-04-14 15:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547466, 495632, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the light.  Great composition, too.</td>', 'Love the light.  Great composition, too.', '2007-04-14 15:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547468, 494996, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very vogue indeed.  And it folds up for easy transport.  Nice shot!</td>', 'Very vogue indeed.  And it folds up for easy transport.  Nice shot!', '2007-04-14 15:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547469, 492878, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nicely represents the freedom a bike can give.  Good composition.</td>', 'Nicely represents the freedom a bike can give.  Good composition.', '2007-04-14 15:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547471, 495868, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great motion capture - very well done.</td>', 'Great motion capture - very well done.', '2007-04-14 15:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547475, 495735, 30982, '<td valign="top">A delightfully perplexing shot - how is there water on two levels?</td>', 'A delightfully perplexing shot - how is there water on two levels?', '2007-04-14 15:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547477, 495290, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like how he''s not all there but the bike is quite solid.  The whole composition works well for me.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I really like how he''s not all there but the bike is quite solid.  The whole composition works well for me.  Nicely done.', '2007-04-14 15:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547478, 495823, 30982, '<td valign="top">Definitely looks like something fit for a travel brochure.  I like the point of view and the shallow DOF.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Definitely looks like something fit for a travel brochure.  I like the point of view and the shallow DOF.  Nicely done.', '2007-04-14 15:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547480, 495985, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perfect.  Love the comp, love the toning, love the setting and the bike.</td>', 'Perfect.  Love the comp, love the toning, love the setting and the bike.', '2007-04-14 15:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547483, 494977, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the high contrast and the way it makes the guy seem headless.  Like the door between the man and the bike.  Like the angle.  Pretty much really like the shot, I guess.</td>', 'I like the high contrast and the way it makes the guy seem headless.  Like the door between the man and the bike.  Like the angle.  Pretty much really like the shot, I guess.', '2007-04-14 15:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547487, 493739, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sweet and soft (not out of focus, just has a soft feel to it.)</td>', 'Sweet and soft (not out of focus, just has a soft feel to it.)', '2007-04-14 15:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547488, 494969, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the point of view on this.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Love the point of view on this.  Nicely done.', '2007-04-14 15:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547498, 495863, 30982, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what possessed people to shoot bicycles in water (a lot of people did) but this is probably my favorite along those lines.  It does indeed beg a story...</td>', 'I don''t know what possessed people to shoot bicycles in water (a lot of people did) but this is probably my favorite along those lines.  It does indeed beg a story...', '2007-04-14 15:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547499, 494193, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the strong lines in this, and the way his jacket pulls your eye to him.</td>', 'Love the strong lines in this, and the way his jacket pulls your eye to him.', '2007-04-14 15:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547500, 495035, 30982, '<td valign="top">I do indeed love the light on this.</td>', 'I do indeed love the light on this.', '2007-04-14 15:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547502, 495165, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and coloring of this.</td>', 'I like the composition and coloring of this.', '2007-04-14 16:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547504, 495797, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen, excellent composition.</td>', 'Nicely seen, excellent composition.', '2007-04-14 16:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547506, 496058, 38032, '<td valign="top">How tha heck ? You must live in CA or something =) - I love this as I''m sure others will too.  The bike is innocent and classic but still present-dayish - the yellow pain in contrast with the other elements is fantastic.  I would put money on this for top 5 at least. 9</td>', 'How tha heck ? You must live in CA or something =) - I love this as I''m sure others will too.  The bike is innocent and classic but still present-dayish - the yellow pain in contrast with the other elements is fantastic.  I would put money on this for top 5 at least. 9', '2007-04-14 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547507, 495790, 34059, '<td valign="top">Very good job! I like the shy mood in which the bike is entering the picture, and the colors of the lights and the reflections are great :) 7</td>', 'Very good job! I like the shy mood in which the bike is entering the picture, and the colors of the lights and the reflections are great :) 7', '2007-04-14 16:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547509, 495178, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is a nicely composed, well lit shot that definitely meets the challenge.  It''s also rather small.  There''s a tutorial on how to size your pictures for DPC so you get the maximum size allowable:<br/>//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26</td>', 'This is a nicely composed, well lit shot that definitely meets the challenge.  It''s also rather small.  There''s a tutorial on how to size your pictures for DPC so you get the maximum size allowable://www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26', '2007-04-14 16:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547510, 496115, 66267, '<td valign="top">might be better if you left the background blurred and the bikes clear, but i like the originality</td>', 'might be better if you left the background blurred and the bikes clear, but i like the originality', '2007-04-14 16:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547512, 494929, 76669, '<td valign="top">A little more light would have helped capture the spinning wheel better.</td>', 'A little more light would have helped capture the spinning wheel better.', '2007-04-14 16:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547515, 495868, 34059, '<td valign="top">Very good panning, the subject is in clear focus, I bet it was not so simple! I only would have preferred a little bit more space on the right of the picture, so to leave the biker the place to go, in this way it seems to me that he has to brake to not hurt himself on the right border of the photo... Hope I was able to express myself!<br/>Anyway a 7 for the excellent technique</td>', 'Very good panning, the subject is in clear focus, I bet it was not so simple! I only would have preferred a little bit more space on the right of the picture, so to leave the biker the place to go, in this way it seems to me that he has to brake to not hurt himself on the right border of the photo... Hope I was able to express myself!Anyway a 7 for the excellent technique', '2007-04-14 16:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547519, 495032, 44825, '<td valign="top">out of focus</td>', 'out of focus', '2007-04-14 16:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547527, 496081, 34059, '<td valign="top">Good focus, lighting, everything seems fine in this picture but still there is nothing special that makes it one of my favorites... maybe I don''t like that the bike was painted, it seems an effort to make an interesting picture without trying with photo techniques</td>', 'Good focus, lighting, everything seems fine in this picture but still there is nothing special that makes it one of my favorites... maybe I don''t like that the bike was painted, it seems an effort to make an interesting picture without trying with photo techniques', '2007-04-14 16:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547533, 493475, 34059, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, interesting point of view, but I don''t like the cyanish sky, looks like the result of a processing meant to improve an overexposed picture.</td>', 'Nice picture, interesting point of view, but I don''t like the cyanish sky, looks like the result of a processing meant to improve an overexposed picture.', '2007-04-14 16:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547536, 495797, 76932, '<td valign="top">:) nice</td>', ':) nice', '2007-04-14 16:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547539, 495985, 76932, '<td valign="top">it caught my eye, I like it...( but there is something that doesn''t convince me..)</td>', 'it caught my eye, I like it...( but there is something that doesn''t convince me..)', '2007-04-14 16:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547541, 495770, 76932, '<td valign="top">:) great</td>', ':) great', '2007-04-14 16:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547605, 495948, 73124, '<td valign="top">Maybe its me, but the picture looks too busy. hard for the eye to settle on a spot.</td>', 'Maybe its me, but the picture looks too busy. hard for the eye to settle on a spot.', '2007-04-14 17:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
