(3555488, 492878, 74747, '<td valign="top">Love this pic! Nice job!</td>', 'Love this pic! Nice job!', '2007-04-17 15:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555493, 496087, 74747, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color!</td>', 'Wonderful color!', '2007-04-17 15:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555495, 495130, 74747, '<td valign="top">How''d you do that? LOL!</td>', 'How''d you do that? LOL!', '2007-04-17 15:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555498, 495290, 74747, '<td valign="top">Cool! Very neat image!</td>', 'Cool! Very neat image!', '2007-04-17 15:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555593, 495740, 76983, '<td valign="top">Wow chris i really do like htis photo!<br/>but i just cant rub it in!<br/>i do like the way you have made the wheel blurred, this must have taken you a very long time!<br/>is that mud?!?! you must clean your bike sometime but the detail is great, nice shot =&gt;9</td>', 'Wow chris i really do like htis photo!but i just cant rub it in!i do like the way you have made the wheel blurred, this must have taken you a very long time!is that mud?!?! you must clean your bike sometime but the detail is great, nice shot =>9', '2007-04-17 16:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555604, 495770, 22517, '<td valign="top">Nice interesting subject, very sharp and good framing. Good grayscale conversion. But I can''t help but wonder if it would have been more striking in colour (probably not or you wouldn''t have removed them...) well done.</td>', 'Nice interesting subject, very sharp and good framing. Good grayscale conversion. But I can''t help but wonder if it would have been more striking in colour (probably not or you wouldn''t have removed them...) well done.', '2007-04-17 16:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555606, 493739, 71550, '<td valign="top">Love the colors. Great Job. 9</td>', 'Love the colors. Great Job. 9', '2007-04-17 16:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555684, 495854, 3087, '<td valign="top">I am admiring the mural itself but this photograph doesn''t seem (to me) to add anything further artistically to what the mural artist created.</td>', 'I am admiring the mural itself but this photograph doesn''t seem (to me) to add anything further artistically to what the mural artist created.', '2007-04-17 17:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555685, 495386, 3087, '<td valign="top">Some interesting repetition and a nice diagonal but not enough interest to really grab me.</td>', 'Some interesting repetition and a nice diagonal but not enough interest to really grab me.', '2007-04-17 17:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555694, 495736, 3087, '<td valign="top">An unusual view, certainly, but simply doesn''t work well for me - the image doesn''t show me anything of interest nor does it''s aesthetics make up for that.</td>', 'An unusual view, certainly, but simply doesn''t work well for me - the image doesn''t show me anything of interest nor does it''s aesthetics make up for that.', '2007-04-17 17:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555695, 495843, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the way the angle/ backdground conveys the "freedom of the open road" aspect of biking that many bikers tell me about (me not being one of them!) The composition, with parts of the bike cropped out and an overall diagonal in the frame, works well.</td>', 'I like the way the angle/ backdground conveys the "freedom of the open road" aspect of biking that many bikers tell me about (me not being one of them!) The composition, with parts of the bike cropped out and an overall diagonal in the frame, works well.', '2007-04-17 17:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555698, 495787, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice repetition, interesting lighting and I like that streak of car light in the background - the car is transient but those bikes have a permanence! Compositionally not hugely strong to me with the bikes plonked so centrally. Also strange (to me) to have space to both sides and above but that crop at the bottom.</td>', 'Nice repetition, interesting lighting and I like that streak of car light in the background - the car is transient but those bikes have a permanence! Compositionally not hugely strong to me with the bikes plonked so centrally. Also strange (to me) to have space to both sides and above but that crop at the bottom.', '2007-04-17 17:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555700, 495981, 3087, '<td valign="top">How surreal! :o)</td>', 'How surreal! :o)', '2007-04-17 17:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555704, 495131, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice motion blur and reflections going on here. Overall composition and crop of the wheel doesn''t work for me - I feel it needs to be cropped more decisively or not at all - and the orange spoke comes in at a strange height at the left - perhaps a touch higher and more at an angle from the corner?</td>', 'Nice motion blur and reflections going on here. Overall composition and crop of the wheel doesn''t work for me - I feel it needs to be cropped more decisively or not at all - and the orange spoke comes in at a strange height at the left - perhaps a touch higher and more at an angle from the corner?', '2007-04-17 17:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555707, 493505, 3087, '<td valign="top">Sweet portrait. I like the half-half background, the vibrant colours, the unusual perspective looking down and his sweet expression.</td>', 'Sweet portrait. I like the half-half background, the vibrant colours, the unusual perspective looking down and his sweet expression.', '2007-04-17 17:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555709, 495868, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice panning though not sure that this particular bike/ individual is really of that much interest to the viewer, not to this one anyway. But technically, I think it''s a great shot.</td>', 'Nice panning though not sure that this particular bike/ individual is really of that much interest to the viewer, not to this one anyway. But technically, I think it''s a great shot.', '2007-04-17 17:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555713, 494048, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oooh nice motion blur and I really like the use of that path leading my eye in the direction of the motion. The "rules" of composition usually direct us not to lead the viewers'' eyes out of the frame but here I think it works really well.</td>', 'Oooh nice motion blur and I really like the use of that path leading my eye in the direction of the motion. The "rules" of composition usually direct us not to lead the viewers'' eyes out of the frame but here I think it works really well.', '2007-04-17 17:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555716, 494632, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice panning and interesting subject. Seems quite oversharpened to me.</td>', 'Nice panning and interesting subject. Seems quite oversharpened to me.', '2007-04-17 17:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555718, 495287, 3087, '<td valign="top">Some nice gritty texture details and interesting shapes.</td>', 'Some nice gritty texture details and interesting shapes.', '2007-04-17 17:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555719, 495898, 3087, '<td valign="top">Repetition is interesting but the image lacks enough to grab me aesthetically or in terms of interest.</td>', 'Repetition is interesting but the image lacks enough to grab me aesthetically or in terms of interest.', '2007-04-17 17:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555732, 495619, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice example of panning with a really nice and uncluttered background colour - the stripe of the pale path within all the green works well. Nice one.</td>', 'Nice example of panning with a really nice and uncluttered background colour - the stripe of the pale path within all the green works well. Nice one.', '2007-04-17 17:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555735, 495961, 3087, '<td valign="top">Strange but interesting.</td>', 'Strange but interesting.', '2007-04-17 17:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555738, 495784, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like all that detail to the left - all the greasy chains and weathered metal. The composition is unusual and so is the lighting/ time of day. Works quite well for me.</td>', 'I like all that detail to the left - all the greasy chains and weathered metal. The composition is unusual and so is the lighting/ time of day. Works quite well for me.', '2007-04-17 17:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555752, 495826, 3087, '<td valign="top">Quite like the way the graffiti matches the biker''s clothing! Nice capture of the manoevre though perhaps not an image with a universal appeal since I suspect a lot of people, like me, won''t have done this kind of stuff, whereas a lot more of us will share memories of regular bike riding shown in other shots. That''s not a bad thing at all but may lead to less shared interest and therefore lower overall votes from the voting masses?</td>', 'Quite like the way the graffiti matches the biker''s clothing! Nice capture of the manoevre though perhaps not an image with a universal appeal since I suspect a lot of people, like me, won''t have done this kind of stuff, whereas a lot more of us will share memories of regular bike riding shown in other shots. That''s not a bad thing at all but may lead to less shared interest and therefore lower overall votes from the voting masses?', '2007-04-17 17:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555753, 494521, 3087, '<td valign="top">Definitely different and that alone makes it more interesting to me than many in the challenge.</td>', 'Definitely different and that alone makes it more interesting to me than many in the challenge.', '2007-04-17 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555758, 495636, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely silhouette... I often find silhouettes difficult as so many times people see a nice sunset and forget to ensure interest of subject matter/ balance of composition in the foreground silhouette subject. Here you''ve got the nice background and the foreground interest/ composition too.</td>', 'Lovely silhouette... I often find silhouettes difficult as so many times people see a nice sunset and forget to ensure interest of subject matter/ balance of composition in the foreground silhouette subject. Here you''ve got the nice background and the foreground interest/ composition too.', '2007-04-17 17:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555759, 494929, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interestingly low key. Nice use of shadow and subtle lighting.</td>', 'Interestingly low key. Nice use of shadow and subtle lighting.', '2007-04-17 17:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555760, 496041, 3087, '<td valign="top">Almost abstract. Lovely, lovely colourds and textures and interesting lines and curves too.</td>', 'Almost abstract. Lovely, lovely colourds and textures and interesting lines and curves too.', '2007-04-17 17:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555765, 496015, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice street candid (or candid-style). The off-centre composition, with the right side offering a clearer view of the yellow cabs behind, works. Not sure about the cropping of his head but perhaps it does make us feel a little closer in to the messenger rather than viewing from a distance?</td>', 'Nice street candid (or candid-style). The off-centre composition, with the right side offering a clearer view of the yellow cabs behind, works. Not sure about the cropping of his head but perhaps it does make us feel a little closer in to the messenger rather than viewing from a distance?', '2007-04-17 17:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555767, 495770, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, lovely punchy black and white with subtle toning.</td>', 'Nice portrait, lovely punchy black and white with subtle toning.', '2007-04-17 17:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555771, 495740, 3087, '<td valign="top">Not a huge fan of the high-key, slightly blown out style though I think it does work reasonably well here. Compostion and textures both great as are the almost abstract shapes.</td>', 'Not a huge fan of the high-key, slightly blown out style though I think it does work reasonably well here. Compostion and textures both great as are the almost abstract shapes.', '2007-04-17 17:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555779, 495670, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness! That''s scary! Not necessarily an aesthetically pleasing image, but definitely interesting!</td>', 'Oh my goodness! That''s scary! Not necessarily an aesthetically pleasing image, but definitely interesting!', '2007-04-17 17:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555781, 496139, 22517, '<td valign="top">Very strong composition and lighting, good choice to use B&amp;W. Convincing photo, well done.</td>', 'Very strong composition and lighting, good choice to use B&W. Convincing photo, well done.', '2007-04-17 17:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555785, 493739, 22517, '<td valign="top">Good use of selective desaturation, it works very well in this photo. Good composition, very nice how the flowers match the red of the bike. Well done.</td>', 'Good use of selective desaturation, it works very well in this photo. Good composition, very nice how the flowers match the red of the bike. Well done.', '2007-04-17 17:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555789, 495439, 22517, '<td valign="top">I like how you kept the shadows as a strong point in the photo. The sepia tone works very well here. Good subject, great title!</td>', 'I like how you kept the shadows as a strong point in the photo. The sepia tone works very well here. Good subject, great title!', '2007-04-17 17:43:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3555792, 496025, 22517, '<td valign="top">Very well lit, and tacksharp! Well done.</td>', 'Very well lit, and tacksharp! Well done.', '2007-04-17 17:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555797, 495985, 22517, '<td valign="top">Good use of negative space which leads the viewer into the photo. The photo conveys the message very well.</td>', 'Good use of negative space which leads the viewer into the photo. The photo conveys the message very well.', '2007-04-17 17:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555804, 496058, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a great image! Interesting, quirky, vibrant, unusual. Each element - the yellow brick wall, the window, the sign itself, the brick paving, the security rod and the bike itself - has it''s place in the overall.</td>', 'Wow, this is a great image! Interesting, quirky, vibrant, unusual. Each element - the yellow brick wall, the window, the sign itself, the brick paving, the security rod and the bike itself - has it''s place in the overall.', '2007-04-17 17:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555805, 494455, 22517, '<td valign="top">The abstract simpleness of the photo is great, good choice of B&amp;W. Well done.</td>', 'The abstract simpleness of the photo is great, good choice of B&W. Well done.', '2007-04-17 17:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555809, 495839, 22517, '<td valign="top">Good framing and stop motion shot. Would love to see his expression, though. Well done.</td>', 'Good framing and stop motion shot. Would love to see his expression, though. Well done.', '2007-04-17 17:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555811, 494193, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! The yellow of the outfit helps pull the focus straight in and contrasts with the predominantly blue bridge and buildings. I like that he''s alone in this cold glass and steel landscape.</td>', 'Nice shot! The yellow of the outfit helps pull the focus straight in and contrasts with the predominantly blue bridge and buildings. I like that he''s alone in this cold glass and steel landscape.', '2007-04-17 17:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555815, 495863, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice reflections there - both of the sky and of the wheel segments. Works well.</td>', 'Nice reflections there - both of the sky and of the wheel segments. Works well.', '2007-04-17 17:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555816, 495959, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice uncluttered backdrop with a weathered texture that matches the old bike.</td>', 'Nice uncluttered backdrop with a weathered texture that matches the old bike.', '2007-04-17 17:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555819, 494996, 22517, '<td valign="top">Shot from the terrace? ;-) Nice and sharp picture, good use of sepia tones, too bad the rear wheel is cut off. Well done.</td>', 'Shot from the terrace? ;-) Nice and sharp picture, good use of sepia tones, too bad the rear wheel is cut off. Well done.', '2007-04-17 17:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555826, 495800, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice motion shot and I like the almost silhouetted nature of the handlebar against the vibrant colours of the environment.</td>', 'Nice motion shot and I like the almost silhouetted nature of the handlebar against the vibrant colours of the environment.', '2007-04-17 17:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555829, 493060, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow, those statues really seem to be watching him ride past!</td>', 'Wow, those statues really seem to be watching him ride past!', '2007-04-17 17:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555836, 495099, 3087, '<td valign="top">Unusual low viewpoint. Nice use of the yellow and green against the blue sky. Subject''s white and black outfit works well within the scene - the white of her top echoes the clouds.</td>', 'Unusual low viewpoint. Nice use of the yellow and green against the blue sky. Subject''s white and black outfit works well within the scene - the white of her top echoes the clouds.', '2007-04-17 17:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555840, 495892, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oooh I can see the concentration on his face! Nice composition - good that you''ve left enough space all around, especially in front. Like the darkness around him too. Yellow and red from bike and shirt add a touch of vibrancy against that black.</td>', 'Oooh I can see the concentration on his face! Nice composition - good that you''ve left enough space all around, especially in front. Like the darkness around him too. Yellow and red from bike and shirt add a touch of vibrancy against that black.', '2007-04-17 17:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555842, 495044, 3087, '<td valign="top">Some interesting shadow shapes created by the combination of bikes and railings and the angle is interesting too. Kind of like the diagonal. Not sure it works for me 100% though.</td>', 'Some interesting shadow shapes created by the combination of bikes and railings and the angle is interesting too. Kind of like the diagonal. Not sure it works for me 100% though.', '2007-04-17 17:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555856, 496081, 3087, '<td valign="top">How odd that the entire bike is painted yellow, gears, chains and all... Think this would work better had it been moved to exclude the barrel and pump which simply clutter this up. Perhaps using this as a prop against a better backdrop would work better?</td>', 'How odd that the entire bike is painted yellow, gears, chains and all... Think this would work better had it been moved to exclude the barrel and pump which simply clutter this up. Perhaps using this as a prop against a better backdrop would work better?', '2007-04-17 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555863, 494973, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''m obviously not getting the tribute aspect of this nor the point about pink being manly but I like the unusual composition with the heaviness of the painted arrow anchoring the bottom of the frame and the small, strange detail of the fallen biker and bike in the background, above.</td>', 'I''m obviously not getting the tribute aspect of this nor the point about pink being manly but I like the unusual composition with the heaviness of the painted arrow anchoring the bottom of the frame and the small, strange detail of the fallen biker and bike in the background, above.', '2007-04-17 17:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555868, 495576, 3087, '<td valign="top">How very odd. Radio Tea. Wonder what that is. And who the lady with her bag and stick is. And what (or who) she''s waiting for. Is it the owner of the bike? Who is the owner of the bike? Where is this? All very intriguing!</td>', 'How very odd. Radio Tea. Wonder what that is. And who the lady with her bag and stick is. And what (or who) she''s waiting for. Is it the owner of the bike? Who is the owner of the bike? Where is this? All very intriguing!', '2007-04-17 17:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555871, 494595, 3087, '<td valign="top">The composition is what stands out to me about this image - I really like the balance of it and the repetition of angles/ shapes. The simplicity of tyres, metal and snow work well too.</td>', 'The composition is what stands out to me about this image - I really like the balance of it and the repetition of angles/ shapes. The simplicity of tyres, metal and snow work well too.', '2007-04-17 17:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555878, 495823, 67841, '<td valign="top">Nice DoF &amp; colors -- 7 --</td>', 'Nice DoF & colors -- 7 --', '2007-04-17 18:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555882, 495336, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oh now I do like this. Very much. Marvellous, marvellous composition with lovely echos of the rusty gear rings in the silvery circles behind. And in that wonderful stripey top left corner curve too. And then there''s that curving rod at the top right that breaks the repetition and just somehow emphasises it even more by doing so. And, oh, those wonderful rust colours and textures against the new and shiny metal. And that little 24T focal point that my eye keeps returning to... Sigh. Lovely. My favourite in the challenge.</td>', 'Oh now I do like this. Very much. Marvellous, marvellous composition with lovely echos of the rusty gear rings in the silvery circles behind. And in that wonderful stripey top left corner curve too. And then there''s that curving rod at the top right that breaks the repetition and just somehow emphasises it even more by doing so. And, oh, those wonderful rust colours and textures against the new and shiny metal. And that little 24T focal point that my eye keeps returning to... Sigh. Lovely. My favourite in the challenge.', '2007-04-17 18:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555884, 495985, 3087, '<td valign="top">What an interesting image! The angles here are so unusual and lead to a really unusual composition which really grabs my attention. The textures, shapes, lovely wide range of tones and slight colour toning all work really well. Intriguing subject matter too. In my top 5 of the challenge.</td>', 'What an interesting image! The angles here are so unusual and lead to a really unusual composition which really grabs my attention. The textures, shapes, lovely wide range of tones and slight colour toning all work really well. Intriguing subject matter too. In my top 5 of the challenge.', '2007-04-17 18:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555885, 494127, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice one! Really like the extremely off-centre composition. The repetitive pattern of the tread provides a nice focus and catches the light nicely too. I really like the shallow depth of field and the quality of the bokeh, especially that diagonal in the almost featureless negative space to the left. Lovely crisp black and white conversion too. In my top 5 of the challenge.</td>', 'Nice one! Really like the extremely off-centre composition. The repetitive pattern of the tread provides a nice focus and catches the light nicely too. I really like the shallow depth of field and the quality of the bokeh, especially that diagonal in the almost featureless negative space to the left. Lovely crisp black and white conversion too. In my top 5 of the challenge.', '2007-04-17 18:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555886, 496107, 3087, '<td valign="top">ROFL this is hilarious! Really tickles my funny bone! Nicely done too with great composition - feels really nicely balanced - and a nice range of tones. In my top 5 of the challenge.</td>', 'ROFL this is hilarious! Really tickles my funny bone! Nicely done too with great composition - feels really nicely balanced - and a nice range of tones. In my top 5 of the challenge.', '2007-04-17 18:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555887, 493806, 3087, '<td valign="top">Fascinating abstract detail study. Love the shallow depth of field, the light and shadow and the big curve sweeping from top right corner. Nice! In my top 5 of the challenge.</td>', 'Fascinating abstract detail study. Love the shallow depth of field, the light and shadow and the big curve sweeping from top right corner. Nice! In my top 5 of the challenge.', '2007-04-17 18:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555959, 496119, 67841, '<td valign="top">Very nice - I''ve gone through 1/3 of challenge entries &amp; this is the first one that I thought was good.<br/> <br/>Nice processing for B&amp;W &amp; overall pleasing composition -- 8 --</td>', 'Very nice - I''ve gone through 1/3 of challenge entries & this is the first one that I thought was good. Nice processing for B&W & overall pleasing composition -- 8 --', '2007-04-17 18:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3555971, 494127, 67841, '<td valign="top">nice composition and b&amp;w processing -- 8 --</td>', 'nice composition and b&w processing -- 8 --', '2007-04-17 18:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3556139, 495682, 76185, '<td valign="top">Composition feels a little too cluttered to me but nicely shot</td>', 'Composition feels a little too cluttered to me but nicely shot', '2007-04-17 19:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3556144, 493606, 76185, '<td valign="top">Great choice of subject although a different setting or angle may have improved it as the trees in the background with the passing traffic distract a little in my opinion.</td>', 'Great choice of subject although a different setting or angle may have improved it as the trees in the background with the passing traffic distract a little in my opinion.', '2007-04-17 19:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3556147, 496139, 76185, '<td valign="top">Nice and dirty :)</td>', 'Nice and dirty :)', '2007-04-17 19:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3556151, 495044, 76185, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, well shot</td>', 'Nice idea, well shot', '2007-04-17 19:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3556157, 495032, 76185, '<td valign="top">Not sure what you were aiming for here, but if intentional the oof effect doesn''t really add anything.</td>', 'Not sure what you were aiming for here, but if intentional the oof effect doesn''t really add anything.', '2007-04-17 19:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3556158, 496041, 76185, '<td valign="top">Like this one, beautiful shot and a subtle take on the challenge.</td>', 'Like this one, beautiful shot and a subtle take on the challenge.', '2007-04-17 19:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3556162, 495336, 76185, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, nicely shot.</td>', 'Interesting subject, nicely shot.', '2007-04-17 19:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3556163, 495819, 76185, '<td valign="top">Looks so abandoned :)</td>', 'Looks so abandoned :)', '2007-04-17 19:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3556165, 495843, 76185, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of shot, works well.</td>', 'Interesting choice of shot, works well.', '2007-04-17 20:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3556168, 495959, 76185, '<td valign="top">Great subject choice, shot has a nice old and dirty feel.</td>', 'Great subject choice, shot has a nice old and dirty feel.', '2007-04-17 20:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3556172, 496107, 76185, '<td valign="top">Interesting set up, works well and it''s well shot.</td>', 'Interesting set up, works well and it''s well shot.', '2007-04-17 20:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3556177, 495808, 76185, '<td valign="top">Makes me think of the childhood freedom of your first real bike :)</td>', 'Makes me think of the childhood freedom of your first real bike :)', '2007-04-17 20:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3556184, 495670, 76185, '<td valign="top">Great location, shot works really well.</td>', 'Great location, shot works really well.', '2007-04-17 20:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3556194, 495961, 76185, '<td valign="top">Fill light feels a little harsh but otherwise nice idea and good shot</td>', 'Fill light feels a little harsh but otherwise nice idea and good shot', '2007-04-17 20:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3556288, 495035, 67841, '<td valign="top">Very nice...</td>', 'Very nice...', '2007-04-17 20:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3556299, 494969, 67841, '<td valign="top">nicely composed &amp; great tone -- 9 --</td>', 'nicely composed & great tone -- 9 --', '2007-04-17 21:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
