(3558241, 494521, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hi Jon - welcome to the world of DPC-unfriendly!  I quite liked this one in the challenge - nice different take on the subject matter and well presented.  Those who liked it REALLY liked it if you look at the average score of your commenters, and you got a lot of comments during voting, too.  Both to me are better indicators that the final score.  Though I will say that a 5.97 doesn''t suck!</td>', 'Hi Jon - welcome to the world of DPC-unfriendly!  I quite liked this one in the challenge - nice different take on the subject matter and well presented.  Those who liked it REALLY liked it if you look at the average score of your commenters, and you got a lot of comments during voting, too.  Both to me are better indicators that the final score.  Though I will say that a 5.97 doesn''t suck!', '2007-04-18 05:46:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558259, 494193, 60915, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by goodman:</b></div><hr/><i> good one, feels a bit tilted to me?  should have finished higher imo. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>hehe feels tilted to me too! I checked it a hundred times and the buildings are perfectly perpendicular. I think it''s an optical illusion caused by the diagonal brace. I was wondering if anyone would notice it :) Thanks Lesley</td>', 'Originally posted by goodman: good one, feels a bit tilted to me?  should have finished higher imo.   hehe feels tilted to me too! I checked it a hundred times and the buildings are perfectly perpendicular. I think it''s an optical illusion caused by the diagonal brace. I was wondering if anyone would notice it :) Thanks Lesley', '2007-04-18 06:08:27.000000', NULL, 0),
