(3561462, 496053, 76257, '<td valign="top">i took this on one exposure ... the only photoshop i did was brightness and contrast ... and this is a photo of me riding, i used a timer ... i did have light streaks in the backround on other tries but this one got the action the best with the best composition in my mind ... oh and i did have a different edit with more brightness and contrast, but it did not come out right on a few websites including DP, that edit is on my myspace ... <a href="//www.myspace.com/patk182" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.myspace.com/patk182</a></td>', 'i took this on one exposure ... the only photoshop i did was brightness and contrast ... and this is a photo of me riding, i used a timer ... i did have light streaks in the backround on other tries but this one got the action the best with the best composition in my mind ... oh and i did have a different edit with more brightness and contrast, but it did not come out right on a few websites including DP, that edit is on my myspace ... //www.myspace.com/patk182', '2007-04-18 23:37:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3561469, 495693, 39747, '<td valign="top">Visually straining (in a good way) so as to force the viewer to focus on the intended subject.  It feels like my eyes are crossing when I attempt to focus on the background! :)<br/> <br/>Speaking of the background - it seems so well captured as a blur that it looks very 3D, as if it''s 30 layers back/deep.  It also looks as though it''s several shots superimposed on one another and then layered under the subject.  Quite complex.<br/> <br/>Awesome; I love this shot!<br/>Well deserved ribbon - congrat''s!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-04-18 22:41:43.</i></td>', 'Visually straining (in a good way) so as to force the viewer to focus on the intended subject.  It feels like my eyes are crossing when I attempt to focus on the background! :) Speaking of the background - it seems so well captured as a blur that it looks very 3D, as if it''s 30 layers back/deep.  It also looks as though it''s several shots superimposed on one another and then layered under the subject.  Quite complex. Awesome; I love this shot!Well deserved ribbon - congrat''s!', '2007-04-18 23:38:52.000000', '2007-04-18 23:41:43.000000', 0),
