(3601718, 493739, 17377, '<td valign="top">Hey Gringo, I totally missed that you ribboned in this challenge! congrats on the blue! Wonderful shot.</td>', 'Hey Gringo, I totally missed that you ribboned in this challenge! congrats on the blue! Wonderful shot.', '2007-05-01 18:42:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3624963, 494996, 40088, '<td valign="top">great photo, people look almost straight up/walking on these bicycles.</td>', 'great photo, people look almost straight up/walking on these bicycles.', '2007-05-07 16:12:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3638992, 493248, 20124, '<td valign="top"><br/>   Thankfully the entire focus wan''t the bike. That would be <br/>less interesting.<br/>  Of course the other focus is a beautiful<br/>woman. But this fact alone does not in any way shape <br/>or form, render the bike less visible. IMO the bike is <br/>even more interesting to look at because an attractive woman<br/>is sitting on it. <br/> <br/> I would prefer the grass to be greener,<br/>perhaps blurring the background even more. But this is<br/>a minor flaw.<br/>  The main flaw in this photo is that the horizon<br/>isn''t straight. It''s slanted up in a steep angle to the right.<br/>  Also I would back up the bike about two feet<br/>so I can see the entire front tire.<br/>  This photo may not be ribbon worthy on a purely technical<br/>sense. But it is sure to  grab one''s  attention. <br/> I gave this one a 7.<br/></td>', '   Thankfully the entire focus wan''t the bike. That would be less interesting.  Of course the other focus is a beautifulwoman. But this fact alone does not in any way shape or form, render the bike less visible. IMO the bike is even more interesting to look at because an attractive womanis sitting on it.   I would prefer the grass to be greener,perhaps blurring the background even more. But this isa minor flaw.  The main flaw in this photo is that the horizonisn''t straight. It''s slanted up in a steep angle to the right.  Also I would back up the bike about two feetso I can see the entire front tire.  This photo may not be ribbon worthy on a purely technicalsense. But it is sure to  grab one''s  attention.  I gave this one a 7.', '2007-05-11 05:42:00.000000', NULL, 0),
