(3827264, 495395, 66833, '<td valign="top">This is just beautiful!</td>', 'This is just beautiful!', '2007-06-24 11:53:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(3829040, 496107, 14986, '<td valign="top">I think this is a cute idea.   I would have liked to have seen better lighting (not shooting into a blown out sky and more light on the subjects) and more detail and emphasis on the line items.  I do like the lower angle you used, but the slope makes the photo appear a bit crooked and would maybe try some slight rotation to counteract that perception.  Looking over a few of your shots, I think you have a good eye for photos.</td>', 'I think this is a cute idea.   I would have liked to have seen better lighting (not shooting into a blown out sky and more light on the subjects) and more detail and emphasis on the line items.  I do like the lower angle you used, but the slope makes the photo appear a bit crooked and would maybe try some slight rotation to counteract that perception.  Looking over a few of your shots, I think you have a good eye for photos.', '2007-06-24 21:44:51.000000', NULL, 0),
